1
00:01:37,690 --> 00:01:42,940
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:45,930
[Episode 6]

3
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:05,040
You want revenge.

4
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,680
Do you think those few
martial wanderers alone

5
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,800
can help you?

6
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:11,520
In this grave called the Xie family,

7
00:02:11,590 --> 00:02:13,650
the living suffer more than the dead.

8
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,000
I'm the only one

9
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,680
who can help you.

10
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,150
Is Your Lordship willing to help me?

11
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:23,470
I used to just

12
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,560
want you to be obedient,

13
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,630
but I realized you're not one
to submit easily.

14
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:29,910
So I figured

15
00:02:30,030 --> 00:02:31,630
I should change my strategy.

16
00:02:35,430 --> 00:02:36,760
Let's form an alliance.

17
00:02:38,010 --> 00:02:43,360
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

18
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,570
Through thick and thin.

19
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:47,840
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

20
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,150
I mean, to protect and support each other.

21
00:02:46,150 --> 00:02:47,120
Are you in?

22
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:51,960
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

23
00:02:51,980 --> 00:02:56,690
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

24
00:02:56,710 --> 00:03:01,330
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

25
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,520
I have plenty of patience.

26
00:03:01,350 --> 00:03:05,400
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

27
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,400
You will figure it out.

28
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:10,000
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

29
00:03:10,020 --> 00:03:15,970
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

30
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:35,680
Mother.

31
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,750
Since you returned to the residence,

32
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:44,310
we haven't talked much.

33
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:46,840
You call me Mother,

34
00:03:47,030 --> 00:03:49,290
but I've not fulfilled my motherly duty,

35
00:03:49,430 --> 00:03:50,800
failing to protect you.

36
00:03:52,310 --> 00:03:53,400
I'm so ashamed.

37
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:56,960
Old Madam

38
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:59,120
wanted to have a good talk with you

39
00:03:59,430 --> 00:04:01,030
after you returned.

40
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:04,280
But she's getting on in years

41
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:07,430
and hasn't been feeling well lately,

42
00:04:07,750 --> 00:04:10,520
so she asked me to talk to you.

43
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,910
That night,

44
00:04:12,910 --> 00:04:14,170
when you were injured,

45
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:16,310
she was

46
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,750
deeply distressed.

47
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,950
I'm taking her away to protect her.

48
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,630
Any objections?

49
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,860
If she was distressed,

50
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:33,240
why did she give me to Lord Yan?

51
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:42,480
You've been away for long,

52
00:04:43,430 --> 00:04:46,600
so naturally, you don't know
the rules of the inner quarters.

53
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,930
With Concubine Mei now calling the shots
both inside and out

54
00:04:49,950 --> 00:04:52,430
and Nanny Rong emboldened by her backing,

55
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:56,000
do you realize the predicament
Old Madam is in?

56
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,070
In all matters,

57
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,690
when the master speaks,

58
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:03,270
servants shouldn't question it.

59
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:06,830
When the husband speaks,
the wife shouldn't question it.

60
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:08,600
When the elders speak,

61
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:14,070
juniors shouldn't question it.

62
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,830
Do you understand?

63
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:19,310
Yes.

64
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,870
I will keep in mind

65
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,240
what you just said.

66
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,760
I had this wound medicine

67
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,390
specially prepared

68
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:31,600
for you.

69
00:05:32,150 --> 00:05:34,560
Apply it for Fourth Lady
after you go back.

70
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,600
Yes.

71
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:37,360
Also,

72
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:38,310
Old Madam

73
00:05:38,310 --> 00:05:40,480
fined Nanny Rong three months' wages.

74
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:42,270
That should

75
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,720
right some wrongs for you.

76
00:05:47,190 --> 00:05:48,680
So my body full of wounds

77
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:51,240
and nearly losing my life
amount to

78
00:05:51,750 --> 00:05:54,350
nothing more than
3 months of someone's wages.

79
00:05:56,950 --> 00:05:58,010
Thank you, Mother.

80
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:59,630
I'll take my leave now

81
00:05:59,950 --> 00:06:01,560
so as not to disturb your rest.

82
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,270
Qingyuan.

83
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,950
These days,

84
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:08,000
rumors about you and Lord Yan

85
00:06:08,680 --> 00:06:09,870
are everywhere.

86
00:06:10,630 --> 00:06:12,270
Old Madam wants you to

87
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,560
stay in the residence

88
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:17,120
and not go out until the rumors die down,

89
00:06:17,950 --> 00:06:21,390
to avoid further gossip.

90
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:24,120
Noted.

91
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,600
That girl...

92
00:06:34,430 --> 00:06:35,630
It's a shame

93
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,159
she looks too much like you.

94
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,040
Go ahead and speak.

95
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,360
Second Madam,

96
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,360
if only you saw it.

97
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,040
In broad daylight,

98
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,480
that girl was

99
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,510
with that man Yan,

100
00:06:50,750 --> 00:06:52,240
tugging at each other

101
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,190
and flirting.

102
00:06:53,190 --> 00:06:54,480
Talk about shameless!

103
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:57,800
As they say,
the apple doesn't fall far from the tree.

104
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,750
A crooked stick will
always have a crooked shadow.

105
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:02,630
The rich and powerful in Hengtang

106
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:05,920
all want to cling to
that corrupt official for protection.

107
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,920
Keeping Qingyuan in our residence

108
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,720
has its uses.

109
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:15,830
Second Madam,

110
00:07:15,830 --> 00:07:17,360
what brilliant foresight!

111
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:18,310
You're so wise.

112
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,360
No wonder you're in charge.

113
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,500
Through and through,

114
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:23,510
the Xie family still has to rely on you.

115
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:24,800
Is that a new bracelet?

116
00:07:27,270 --> 00:07:28,680
Looks quite heavy.

117
00:07:30,310 --> 00:07:31,430
You have a good eye.

118
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,070
It's just coated with gold dust,

119
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:34,950
not worth much.

120
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:40,310
You manage the Xie Estate.

121
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:42,120
So many eyes are on you.

122
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,120
At your age,

123
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,000
I shouldn't have to teach you

124
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:47,720
not to flaunt your wealth.

125
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:50,380
Are you dying for others to see

126
00:07:50,380 --> 00:07:51,840
your little illicit gain?

127
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,520
Second Madam,

128
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,130
I have no other intentions.

129
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,360
I just want to

130
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,950
handle things well for you.

131
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:00,800
Alright.

132
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,310
I'm not blaming you.

133
00:08:04,430 --> 00:08:06,190
If I don't feed my underlings well,

134
00:08:06,190 --> 00:08:07,310
that little silver

135
00:08:07,750 --> 00:08:09,610
won't come into my pocket either.

136
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,950
In my eyes,

137
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:16,230
this thing of yours

138
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:17,750
isn't really a big deal.

139
00:08:20,310 --> 00:08:23,270
I just hope it doesn't set off suspicion

140
00:08:23,390 --> 00:08:26,720
and lead people to discover
the dealings behind the estate.

141
00:08:27,430 --> 00:08:29,800
The consequences will be too heavy to bear

142
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:32,110
even with the two of us combined.

143
00:08:34,909 --> 00:08:36,370
You're absolutely right.

144
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:39,169
I'm aware of the gravity of the situation.

145
00:08:42,740 --> 00:08:45,900
[Danyue Pavilion]

146
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,510
My Lady,

147
00:08:49,670 --> 00:08:51,080
you really hit the nail on the head.

148
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,000
I probed into it.

149
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,960
Nanny Rong is

150
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:55,150
indeed a dog serving multiple masters.

151
00:08:55,150 --> 00:08:56,690
Every night after she gets off work,

152
00:08:56,690 --> 00:08:58,960
she goes to Liuhua Courtyard
to tip them off.

153
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,630
She and Mei Yinghua must be

154
00:09:00,630 --> 00:09:03,030
up to something shady in the estate.

155
00:09:03,750 --> 00:09:05,270
No one wakes up early for no reason.

156
00:09:05,270 --> 00:09:07,030
Overseeing such a lucrative estate,
they must have

157
00:09:07,030 --> 00:09:08,670
skimmed a hefty profit for themselves.

158
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:09,750
Exactly.

159
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:11,550
She bought a gold bracelet days ago,

160
00:09:11,550 --> 00:09:13,000
and couldn't stop showing it off.

161
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,860
I wonder how much hard-earned money
she's extorted from the tenants.

162
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:19,720
With Mei Yinghua backing her

163
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:22,150
and Old Madam giving her free rein,

164
00:09:22,630 --> 00:09:24,290
it's no wonder a nanny like her

165
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,280
is lawless in the Xie household.

166
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:28,150
She goes around bullying the weak,

167
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:29,260
shortchanges the tenant farmers,

168
00:09:29,260 --> 00:09:30,990
and runs amok in the residence.

169
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,270
To bring her down,

170
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,940
you have to dismantle her backing

171
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,000
and leave her completely on her own.

172
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,460
You're right, My Lady.

173
00:09:41,790 --> 00:09:42,440
Baoxian.

174
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:45,960
Do something for me.

175
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:51,320
Greetings, Lord Yan!

176
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:52,790
Well,

177
00:09:53,080 --> 00:09:54,080
Lord Yan,

178
00:09:54,390 --> 00:09:56,750
we're all busy with governmental affairs.

179
00:09:56,750 --> 00:09:58,120
May I ask what this meeting

180
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,030
is about?

181
00:09:59,630 --> 00:10:01,440
Well, i-it's not really the time

182
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:03,270
to be painting the town red.

183
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:05,870
I was afraid

184
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:08,240
that you lords are too busy,

185
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:11,510
so I invited you to revisit this place.

186
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:14,090
Perhaps you might recall something.

187
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:17,480
The murderer who assassinated
the Xie Estate manager

188
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:20,540
also came here to drink with courtesans
before he died.

189
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,320
I wonder

190
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:24,550
who he came here with that night.

191
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:26,950
Was it you?

192
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:29,120
No, no.

193
00:10:29,270 --> 00:10:30,390
It wasn't me.

194
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,600
Or you?

195
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,200
N-No, My Lord.

196
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:35,800
I truly have no clue about it.

197
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,090
That shouldn't be.

198
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:41,360
Only a handful of
Zuixian Tavern flower tokens

199
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:43,150
exist in all of Hengtang.

200
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:45,480
How did it end up on the murderer?

201
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:51,200
Lord Guo, I remember you have one.

202
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,270
Take it out and let us see.

203
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,120
Lord Yan,

204
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:54,730
you must be joking.

205
00:10:54,750 --> 00:10:57,240
How could I have such a token?

206
00:11:01,270 --> 00:11:01,960
Right.

207
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,720
I was just joking.

208
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,270
Why's everyone so nervous?

209
00:11:12,030 --> 00:11:13,000
Sit, sit.

210
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:16,000
-Come on. Please.
-Lord Guo, please.

211
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,200
-Sit, sit.
-Sure.

212
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,240
However,

213
00:11:19,550 --> 00:11:22,680
it seems the estate manager
lost a ledger before he died.

214
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,120
Lord Guo, do you think

215
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:29,630
the ledger was hidden by the killer,

216
00:11:29,630 --> 00:11:30,600
or

217
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:32,610
did it really fall into the river?

218
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,120
Lord Yan,

219
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:37,720
how... would I know?

220
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:40,550
Perhaps it really fell into the river.

221
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:41,610
Fell into the river.

222
00:11:41,610 --> 00:11:42,600
It fell into the river.

223
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,600
Right, right.

224
00:11:46,550 --> 00:11:48,240
Speaking of the ledger,

225
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:50,600
I've heard a story.

226
00:11:51,030 --> 00:11:52,600
In a certain estate,

227
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:55,750
the dividends meant for the tenant farmers

228
00:11:55,750 --> 00:11:57,280
were repeatedly deducted.

229
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,440
This left the tenants with no choice

230
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:01,510
but to borrow money from the government.

231
00:12:01,510 --> 00:12:03,240
Money is easy to borrow

232
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,720
but hard to repay.

233
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,870
The compound interest accumulates quickly.

234
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:07,840
So the people

235
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:10,500
could only use their food at home
as collateral.

236
00:12:10,510 --> 00:12:11,360
As time passed,

237
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:12,360
the food ran out,

238
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,290
and they couldn't repay the money.

239
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,790
Take a guess, Your Lordships.

240
00:12:15,790 --> 00:12:17,390
Where did the money

241
00:12:17,510 --> 00:12:18,910
they borrowed come from?

242
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,200
I have no clue.

243
00:12:26,670 --> 00:12:28,440
-Me neither.
-Me neither.

244
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,200
I think the real kicker

245
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:34,630
of this story is that

246
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:38,030
the borrowed money is exactly

247
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:40,550
the money taken from the tenants' pockets

248
00:12:40,550 --> 00:12:41,670
in the first place.

249
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,910
Interesting, isn't it?

250
00:12:47,910 --> 00:12:48,860
Yes, yes!

251
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:51,240
Yes! S-So very interesting.

252
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,730
Interesting.

253
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,550
They say the ledger fell into the river.

254
00:12:56,550 --> 00:12:57,550
Do you believe it?

255
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,610
I don't believe it anyway.

256
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,630
Neither do I.

257
00:13:00,670 --> 00:13:01,670
But Your Lordship,

258
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:03,150
the ledger hasn't been found yet.

259
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:04,270
Won't doing this

260
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,550
alert the enemy?

261
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:07,360
That's exactly why

262
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:09,750
we have to alert the enemy.

263
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,320
Keep a close eye on them these few days.

264
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:14,200
They'll definitely lose their composure

265
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:16,270
and reveal something useful to us.

266
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:17,290
-Yes.
-Yes.

267
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,200
Has Fourth Lady been here recently?

268
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,570
No word from her yet.

269
00:13:32,690 --> 00:13:35,100
[Chuxiang Pavilion]

270
00:13:33,550 --> 00:13:34,750
-Guo.
-Second Young Master!

271
00:13:34,750 --> 00:13:35,320
Come, come.

272
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:37,200
Why did you start drinking by yourself?

273
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,240
Come on, join me.

274
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:40,700
Why didn't you get a lady
to sing a tune or two?

275
00:13:42,550 --> 00:13:43,480
Let's drink.

276
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,390
Guo,

277
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:49,440
what's wrong?

278
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,500
Seems like you have a lot on your mind.

279
00:13:51,870 --> 00:13:54,200
Did something go wrong with our business?

280
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:55,480
It's fine.

281
00:14:00,750 --> 00:14:01,950
Second Young Master.

282
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,270
I heard that

283
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:04,630
Lord Yan has been getting

284
00:14:04,630 --> 00:14:06,560
quite close to your family of late.

285
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,630
Have you heard anything about it?

286
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:12,510
Of course I have!

287
00:14:12,790 --> 00:14:14,080
You know what?

288
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:17,150
Lord Yan's taken a fancy
to my fourth sister.

289
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,960
They're really a match made in heaven.

290
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,080
-A handsome couple.
-Yeah, okay.

291
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,030
A perfect match.

292
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,480
What I really want to ask is

293
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,440
about the treasure

294
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:26,270
I asked you to keep for me before.

295
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:28,260
Have you been keeping it safe?

296
00:14:29,790 --> 00:14:30,550
Treasure?

297
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:31,860
What treasure?

298
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,440
Oh, you mean those picture books.

299
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:38,320
Yes, yes.

300
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,750
I'm really sorry about them.

301
00:14:41,910 --> 00:14:44,310
My mother found them and confiscated them.

302
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:44,960
Confiscated?

303
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:47,890
-I didn't know how to tell you—
-W-What about the box?

304
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:49,030
What box?

305
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:51,320
The wooden box that held the books.

306
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:52,390
There's an ink seal of

307
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:53,720
Jinsu Pastry Shop on it.

308
00:14:53,870 --> 00:14:55,070
Did she take that too?

309
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,270
Second Young Master,

310
00:15:00,270 --> 00:15:01,750
didn't I tell you

311
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:03,360
to keep it safe for me

312
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:05,150
and not to give it to anyone else?

313
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:07,240
-But my mother isn't just anyone else.
-You...

314
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,630
What's wrong, Guo?

315
00:15:08,630 --> 00:15:09,630
Why so nervous?

316
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,270
Is that box so valuable?

317
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,390
Relax.

318
00:15:18,750 --> 00:15:19,390
How about this?

319
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:20,000
When I go back,

320
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,200
I'll ask her about it.

321
00:15:21,910 --> 00:15:23,240
You must ask her. Please.

322
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,200
You have to.

323
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:25,910
Come. Let's drink.

324
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,200
Mother!

325
00:15:31,510 --> 00:15:32,150
Mother,

326
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:33,870
where did I put my wooden box?

327
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:34,870
Mothe—

328
00:15:36,510 --> 00:15:37,630
Mother, you're here.

329
00:15:37,630 --> 00:15:38,720
My wooden box...

330
00:15:42,790 --> 00:15:43,650
Oh! There it is—

331
00:15:44,510 --> 00:15:44,960
W-What is it?

332
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:47,320
Are you really dumb or just pretending?

333
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:48,910
Don't you know what's in it?

334
00:15:48,910 --> 00:15:49,710
What's wrong?

335
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,870
It's just a few books of eroti...

336
00:15:51,870 --> 00:15:53,030
erotic art.

337
00:15:54,910 --> 00:15:57,330
Underneath those books of yours is

338
00:15:57,360 --> 00:16:00,020
the ledger for
the illicit sale of relief grain.

339
00:16:01,440 --> 00:16:02,750
W-What?

340
00:16:03,910 --> 00:16:05,000
Why didn't I know?

341
00:16:06,750 --> 00:16:08,630
No wonder Guo Baofeng was so nervous.

342
00:16:08,630 --> 00:16:10,200
So he passed the hot potato

343
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,200
to me!

344
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:14,670
You can't even manage a small estate well.

345
00:16:15,270 --> 00:16:16,480
If this thing

346
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,870
falls into Yan Rui's hands,

347
00:16:17,870 --> 00:16:18,960
when implicated,

348
00:16:18,960 --> 00:16:20,390
you'll be beheaded!

349
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:23,600
Mother,

350
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,550
I'll go beg Lord Wei now.

351
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:26,200
You...

352
00:16:26,910 --> 00:16:29,110
Why'd you deliver yourself to his door?

353
00:16:29,150 --> 00:16:30,630
Wei Changyan would love nothing more

354
00:16:30,630 --> 00:16:32,290
than for you to die for him now.

355
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:34,610
Listen carefully.

356
00:16:34,750 --> 00:16:36,150
You can't let anyone know

357
00:16:36,150 --> 00:16:37,950
that this ledger is in our hands.

358
00:16:38,790 --> 00:16:39,360
Also,

359
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,790
if Guo Baofeng asks,

360
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:43,910
just say

361
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:45,000
I burned it.

362
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:46,960
Okay.

363
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,720
Yes, I got it.

364
00:16:50,150 --> 00:16:51,320
Second Madam!

365
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,840
-Second Madam!
-You may leave.

366
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:55,360
Okay.

367
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,440
-Second Madam.
-Goodness.

368
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:03,480
What's the panic?

369
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:04,960
Second Madam,

370
00:17:05,109 --> 00:17:06,160
our estate is

371
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:07,920
in big trouble!

372
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,319
What could've happened?

373
00:17:09,750 --> 00:17:12,680
Didn't we withhold the tenants' wages?

374
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,510
They heard about our usury business.

375
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:15,480
Having nowhere else

376
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,069
to turn for their money,

377
00:17:17,069 --> 00:17:19,000
they're now inciting people to riot!

378
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,640
A disaster also hit us this year,

379
00:17:20,640 --> 00:17:22,790
and all the money lent out
can't be recovered.

380
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:24,050
With all this going on,

381
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,010
things are

382
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:26,880
going to get real messy.

383
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:31,240
Everything and everyone is a headache.

384
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:33,840
Where did those tenants

385
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,830
get such reliable news?

386
00:17:37,160 --> 00:17:38,400
Could someone be

387
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,120
leaking information behind our backs?

388
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,930
I'm also wondering about this.

389
00:17:45,830 --> 00:17:47,360
It wasn't me, Second Madam.

390
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:50,480
I absolutely did not leak a single word.

391
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,000
Second Madam.

392
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,510
About us moving the money,

393
00:17:59,790 --> 00:18:02,240
only you and I know.

394
00:18:04,110 --> 00:18:05,200
If it wasn't you,

395
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:07,460
could it have been me?

396
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,480
I'm innocent.

397
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:10,920
You know that

398
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,000
I guard our estate

399
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,110
like my own life.

400
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,640
Why'd I leak it?

401
00:18:16,790 --> 00:18:19,240
I value my life and this prosperity

402
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:20,240
too much for that.

403
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:22,350
Right?

404
00:18:26,270 --> 00:18:27,070
Alright.

405
00:18:27,720 --> 00:18:29,250
I'll figure something out.

406
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:30,240
You may leave.

407
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,480
She's losing her marbles.

408
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,140
Keep a close eye on her.

409
00:18:48,830 --> 00:18:49,960
Don't let her handle

410
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:52,240
anything important.

411
00:18:53,070 --> 00:18:53,870
Second Madam,

412
00:18:54,070 --> 00:18:57,000
if this gets out,
we can't keep it under wraps for long.

413
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:58,480
We need to plan ahead.

414
00:19:03,070 --> 00:19:04,240
Here, Qingyuan.

415
00:19:05,350 --> 00:19:06,750
Thank you, Second Madam.

416
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:09,000
What's the occasion today?

417
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:10,880
You actually thought of

418
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,960
inviting Qingyuan for a meal.

419
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:14,510
Old Madam,

420
00:19:14,830 --> 00:19:17,750
Nanny Rong and I are
getting up there in years.

421
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:20,640
I fear we may no longer have the stamina
to oversee the estate

422
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,000
day in and day out.

423
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,720
If we don't visit,

424
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:25,790
we can't keep the subordinates in check.

425
00:19:25,790 --> 00:19:28,440
So after thinking it over,

426
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:32,270
I thought it'd be better to find someone
from the younger generation

427
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:33,720
to help me out.

428
00:19:39,110 --> 00:19:41,440
It's so kind of you
to care about this old servant.

429
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,920
With these old bones of mine,

430
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:44,050
I'm used to working.

431
00:19:44,160 --> 00:19:45,360
If I had nothing to do,

432
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:47,530
I wouldn't know what to do with myself.

433
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,070
Qingyuan,

434
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:57,510
you've suffered so much outside
all these years.

435
00:19:57,790 --> 00:19:59,920
Now that you're back in the Xie family,

436
00:20:00,110 --> 00:20:02,790
I must make sure
you're treated with the utmost care.

437
00:20:02,790 --> 00:20:05,240
But you have a strong personality.

438
00:20:05,590 --> 00:20:08,680
You're certainly not one to accept

439
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:10,480
gifts of gold and jewels.

440
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:13,070
So I thought I should

441
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:15,720
hand the estate over

442
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,830
to Qingyuan to manage.

443
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:22,960
Second Madam.

444
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,590
Do you think I'm cut out for business?

445
00:20:25,830 --> 00:20:27,290
Besides, isn't the estate

446
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:29,440
usually managed by Second Brother?

447
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:31,110
If I take it over so abruptly,

448
00:20:31,110 --> 00:20:32,640
it might be inappropriate.

449
00:20:33,510 --> 00:20:35,350
What's inappropriate about it?

450
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:37,920
Your second brother caused such a big mess

451
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,590
at the government office.

452
00:20:39,750 --> 00:20:41,350
He can't even take care of himself.

453
00:20:41,350 --> 00:20:43,880
How could I leave the estate to him?

454
00:20:44,310 --> 00:20:46,550
You have the skills and the guts.

455
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:49,350
I'll feel at ease
leaving the estate to you.

456
00:20:53,830 --> 00:20:55,960
Old Madam, what do you think?

457
00:21:00,510 --> 00:21:02,480
Handing over the estate
is no small matter.

458
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:04,310
Why rush, Second Madam?

459
00:21:04,750 --> 00:21:06,880
Why not wait for the patriarch to return?

460
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:08,940
It won't be too late to let him decide.

461
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:11,240
The patriarch has
so many things to deal with.

462
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:13,920
No need to bother him
with such a small household matter.

463
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:16,550
But Fourth Lady is
of noble and precious birth.

464
00:21:16,720 --> 00:21:19,550
She probably can't even
tell wheatgrass from chives.

465
00:21:19,550 --> 00:21:21,680
Old Madam, I'm just a foolish servant.

466
00:21:21,750 --> 00:21:24,160
But even in the hardest of times,
the estate's never

467
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:26,160
let the household go hungry, has it?

468
00:21:29,070 --> 00:21:31,110
Nanny Rong, you're right to criticize me.

469
00:21:31,110 --> 00:21:32,750
I'm not as capable as you.

470
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:36,550
But I don't know where I heard that

471
00:21:36,880 --> 00:21:39,520
the estate spends
hundreds of taels of silver yearly

472
00:21:39,520 --> 00:21:41,480
to build some canal.

473
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:43,030
Yet, for some reason,

474
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,550
the tenant farmers there

475
00:21:44,550 --> 00:21:46,270
can't even dig a well.

476
00:21:49,240 --> 00:21:51,310
I wonder where that canal

477
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,480
leads to.

478
00:21:54,110 --> 00:21:54,960
What canal?

479
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,530
There's no such thing.

480
00:21:56,920 --> 00:21:58,430
On the contrary,

481
00:21:58,590 --> 00:22:00,390
why is my bracelet on your wrist?

482
00:22:01,590 --> 00:22:02,650
First Madam, look.

483
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:05,420
Where's the bracelet?

484
00:22:06,110 --> 00:22:07,240
Preposterous!

485
00:22:07,240 --> 00:22:07,830
First Madam,

486
00:22:07,830 --> 00:22:08,640
my bracelet...

487
00:22:08,640 --> 00:22:09,200
I...

488
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:11,240
What bracelet?

489
00:22:11,550 --> 00:22:12,440
On my arm,

490
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:15,680
there are only scars left by you, Nanny.

491
00:22:16,030 --> 00:22:17,700
It hurts to have my scars

492
00:22:18,030 --> 00:22:19,790
on display for everyone.

493
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:21,080
It's so humiliating.

494
00:22:29,310 --> 00:22:31,200
What a loyal servant you are.

495
00:22:31,440 --> 00:22:33,400
It's not enough that
you took the law into your own hands

496
00:22:33,400 --> 00:22:35,160
and harmed Qingyuan before.

497
00:22:35,310 --> 00:22:37,350
Now you dare to be even more insolent

498
00:22:37,350 --> 00:22:39,070
right in my presence!

499
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:42,280
Misappropriating funds
and abusing your master!

500
00:22:43,200 --> 00:22:44,720
Confiscate her badge!

501
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:48,000
The estate will be

502
00:22:48,640 --> 00:22:50,110
handed over to Qingyuan.

503
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,310
She's our own flesh and blood.

504
00:22:54,310 --> 00:22:56,790
No outsider gets to mistreat her.

505
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,880
And you.

506
00:23:00,200 --> 00:23:02,310
Bring such filth near me again,

507
00:23:02,310 --> 00:23:03,570
and you'll be stripped

508
00:23:03,720 --> 00:23:05,180
of your management rights

509
00:23:05,240 --> 00:23:07,160
over this household.

510
00:23:12,590 --> 00:23:13,990
Old Madam, you're right.

511
00:23:14,550 --> 00:23:15,640
You old servant,

512
00:23:15,790 --> 00:23:17,480
how dare you bully Qingyuan?

513
00:23:17,480 --> 00:23:18,550
See how I deal with you.

514
00:23:18,550 --> 00:23:19,880
Chuntai, beat her hard!

515
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:28,680
I've lost my appetite.

516
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:31,790
Careful.

517
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:40,920
Old Madam!

518
00:23:52,550 --> 00:23:53,880
I clearly saw

519
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:55,680
my bracelet on your arm.

520
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:59,160
Is this what you're talking about?

521
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:05,810
You did do it on purpose.

522
00:24:06,350 --> 00:24:07,010
Come with me

523
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:08,790
to report to Old Madam.

524
00:24:09,110 --> 00:24:10,400
Let's settle this head-on.

525
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:12,330
Nanny, you must be getting senile.

526
00:24:12,880 --> 00:24:14,480
So what if I did it on purpose?

527
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:17,460
I'm Old Madam's biological granddaughter.

528
00:24:17,750 --> 00:24:18,950
Settle this head-on?

529
00:24:19,070 --> 00:24:21,440
Do you think
she'll side with a servant like you?

530
00:24:21,440 --> 00:24:22,970
You deliberately set me up.

531
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:24,880
I've endured for decades

532
00:24:25,030 --> 00:24:26,400
in the Xie Residence.

533
00:24:26,830 --> 00:24:28,550
You, a bastard who came out of nowhere,

534
00:24:28,550 --> 00:24:30,810
have no right to steal the estate from me!

535
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:40,790
Bastard?

536
00:24:42,640 --> 00:24:44,680
What a familiar title.

537
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,640
Nineteen years ago,

538
00:24:47,830 --> 00:24:50,000
when you beat my mother black and blue

539
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:52,310
and she begged you for mercy,

540
00:24:53,030 --> 00:24:54,830
you called her that too.

541
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:57,830
My mother never hurt anyone.

542
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,410
Why did you mistreat her like that?

543
00:25:01,960 --> 00:25:03,310
So you came for revenge.

544
00:25:04,550 --> 00:25:06,790
What does your mother's business
have to do with me?

545
00:25:06,790 --> 00:25:09,030
I was just following my master's orders.

546
00:25:09,030 --> 00:25:10,350
If you're that capable,

547
00:25:10,350 --> 00:25:12,160
go target those high and mighty masters!

548
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:13,310
How did you know?

549
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:18,070
That is my plan.

550
00:25:21,030 --> 00:25:22,720
Justice has a long arm.

551
00:25:23,750 --> 00:25:25,640
The evil you committed back then

552
00:25:27,270 --> 00:25:28,510
has finally caught up with you.

553
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:29,480
What long arm of justice?

554
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,740
Give my bracelet back!

555
00:25:31,270 --> 00:25:34,200
I'm just a servant who climbed the ladder!

556
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:35,400
Give it back!

557
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:37,330
If you have the guts, go after them!

558
00:25:41,070 --> 00:25:42,070
Look at yourself.

559
00:25:42,880 --> 00:25:43,830
How pathetic.

560
00:25:44,790 --> 00:25:47,240
You spent your entire life
clawing your way up,

561
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:48,270
only to become

562
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:51,880
a mere dog
for a high official's concubine.

563
00:26:09,520 --> 00:26:13,110
[Danyue Pavilion]

564
00:26:17,240 --> 00:26:18,160
My Lady.

565
00:26:18,310 --> 00:26:19,750
The estate Mei Yinghua gave you

566
00:26:19,750 --> 00:26:21,080
is indeed problematic.

567
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,160
They say

568
00:26:22,240 --> 00:26:24,440
the estate has been
using the tenants' money

569
00:26:24,440 --> 00:26:25,550
for usury for years,

570
00:26:25,550 --> 00:26:27,750
delaying the payments owed to tenants.

571
00:26:27,960 --> 00:26:30,030
Now the matter has blown up.

572
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:32,200
I'm afraid it'll be hard to suppress.

573
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:34,680
It might reach Old Madam soon.

574
00:26:35,030 --> 00:26:35,920
It's fine.

575
00:26:36,200 --> 00:26:37,200
One step at a time.

576
00:26:37,720 --> 00:26:39,000
I'm already studying

577
00:26:39,110 --> 00:26:40,480
the estate's ledger.

578
00:26:41,400 --> 00:26:42,680
Did you find any clues

579
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:43,880
in the ledger?

580
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:45,920
Since she had the nerve to hand it over,

581
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:47,790
she must've scrubbed it clean.

582
00:26:47,920 --> 00:26:50,120
This ledger shows absolutely nothing.

583
00:26:50,550 --> 00:26:52,310
Only by going to the estate to crosscheck

584
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:54,030
might I find some holes.

585
00:26:54,750 --> 00:26:56,830
To bring down Nanny Rong,

586
00:26:56,890 --> 00:26:58,420
you took on this hot potato.

587
00:26:58,590 --> 00:27:00,250
That's a massive price to pay.

588
00:27:00,350 --> 00:27:02,350
And look at your body full of wounds.

589
00:27:02,350 --> 00:27:04,950
What kind of heiress
chooses to live like this?

590
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:09,510
Baoxian,

591
00:27:09,750 --> 00:27:10,790
it's all thanks to you

592
00:27:10,790 --> 00:27:12,640
for swiping that bracelet for me.

593
00:27:12,640 --> 00:27:14,460
Otherwise, I wouldn't have been able to

594
00:27:14,460 --> 00:27:16,590
take over this hot potato so smoothly.

595
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:40,160
Granny.

596
00:27:45,070 --> 00:27:46,240
My baby!

597
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:47,880
Come here.

598
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:50,370
I missed you so much.

599
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:51,270
Granny.

600
00:27:51,830 --> 00:27:52,960
I brought you a gift.

601
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:57,070
Why do you always bring me gifts
when you come back?

602
00:27:57,160 --> 00:27:58,960
I don't care about those things.

603
00:27:58,960 --> 00:28:00,070
All I care about is

604
00:28:00,650 --> 00:28:02,720
you coming back early to be with me.

605
00:28:04,030 --> 00:28:04,790
Granny,

606
00:28:05,110 --> 00:28:06,400
now's not the time yet.

607
00:28:06,830 --> 00:28:07,880
But I promise you

608
00:28:08,070 --> 00:28:09,400
I'll be as quick as I can.

609
00:28:10,830 --> 00:28:11,830
As for that money,

610
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:13,270
just look at it as

611
00:28:13,270 --> 00:28:14,870
holding onto it on my behalf.

612
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:16,160
Alright!

613
00:28:18,440 --> 00:28:19,350
Just now, I smelled

614
00:28:19,350 --> 00:28:21,840
my favorite pear curd.

615
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,440
You can't eat this.

616
00:28:24,440 --> 00:28:26,240
I saved it for a regular customer.

617
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,240
If you want some,

618
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,640
I'll make it fresh for you

619
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,880
with extra honey.

620
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:32,430
Granny,

621
00:28:32,550 --> 00:28:34,110
I've only been gone a few days,

622
00:28:34,110 --> 00:28:36,240
and you have a new regular I don't know?

623
00:28:36,810 --> 00:28:39,780
It's that Young Master Yan
from the capital.

624
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:42,640
He's been coming
to support my business lately.

625
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:44,480
He's very nice

626
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:45,590
and has no airs.

627
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,920
A couple of days ago, he even

628
00:28:47,920 --> 00:28:49,120
helped me move flour.

629
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:51,770
He was worried
I'd fall and sprain something.

630
00:28:54,270 --> 00:28:55,310
Does he come often?

631
00:28:55,310 --> 00:28:56,030
When?

632
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:57,240
Why didn't I know?

633
00:28:58,510 --> 00:29:00,010
It's quite a coincidence.

634
00:29:00,270 --> 00:29:02,350
You two always arrive one after another.

635
00:29:02,350 --> 00:29:04,480
You leave, and he shows up right after.

636
00:29:07,480 --> 00:29:09,030
What's wrong, Dear?

637
00:29:09,550 --> 00:29:11,200
Why the frown?

638
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:13,680
Are you still misunderstanding him?

639
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:16,000
He's really a nice person.

640
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:18,400
Granny,

641
00:29:18,790 --> 00:29:20,590
the human heart is hard to gauge.

642
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:22,840
Anyway, don't trust outsiders easily.

643
00:29:23,440 --> 00:29:24,110
Outsiders?

644
00:29:27,510 --> 00:29:29,040
Fourth Lady, your words are

645
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:30,400
truly heartbreaking.

646
00:29:32,070 --> 00:29:33,240
Yan,

647
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,860
you came at the right time.

648
00:29:35,070 --> 00:29:35,590
Look,

649
00:29:35,790 --> 00:29:37,440
the soup is ready.

650
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:38,830
This time,

651
00:29:39,110 --> 00:29:41,550
it's perilla, ginger, and jujube soup.

652
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:42,690
With your condition,

653
00:29:42,690 --> 00:29:43,960
you need to eat more things

654
00:29:43,960 --> 00:29:46,070
that warm the stomach and dispel cold.

655
00:29:46,070 --> 00:29:47,130
Thank you, Granny.

656
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:48,920
It smells so good.

657
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,640
I'll pour a bowl for you.

658
00:29:53,110 --> 00:29:54,710
Come out with me for a second.

659
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,070
Lord Yan,

660
00:30:03,200 --> 00:30:04,310
I don't know why

661
00:30:04,510 --> 00:30:06,480
you're relentlessly pursuing me.

662
00:30:07,270 --> 00:30:08,200
I've already gotten

663
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:09,640
the things you wanted for you.

664
00:30:09,640 --> 00:30:11,510
I've also done what you asked me to do.

665
00:30:11,510 --> 00:30:13,070
Why won't you let me go?

666
00:30:17,750 --> 00:30:19,440
Granny doesn't know a thing.

667
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:21,750
All your schemes to get close to her
are useless.

668
00:30:21,750 --> 00:30:23,610
You won't get anything out of her.

669
00:30:25,830 --> 00:30:27,440
Have you never truly given anyone

670
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:28,440
your heart?

671
00:30:29,310 --> 00:30:32,040
Is that why you question
the sincerity of others?

672
00:30:33,110 --> 00:30:35,590
I have no ulterior motives
towards Granny Chen.

673
00:30:35,590 --> 00:30:38,240
She just reminds me of
my loved ones who are gone,

674
00:30:38,240 --> 00:30:40,070
so I want to look out for her.

675
00:30:40,110 --> 00:30:41,000
That's all.

676
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:44,510
I swear every word

677
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,270
I said is true.

678
00:30:47,090 --> 00:30:53,930
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

679
00:30:49,030 --> 00:30:50,830
You'll say anything, won't you?

680
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:52,880
What do you mean?

681
00:30:53,590 --> 00:30:54,920
I'm completely sincere.

682
00:30:53,960 --> 00:31:01,150
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

683
00:31:01,250 --> 00:31:04,770
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

684
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:05,240
You two are...

685
00:31:04,800 --> 00:31:07,970
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

686
00:31:05,750 --> 00:31:06,550
Granny Chen,

687
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,070
I forgot to tell you that

688
00:31:07,990 --> 00:31:15,130
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

689
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,440
Yunya and I survived

690
00:31:09,440 --> 00:31:11,070
ordeals together in the Xie Residence.

691
00:31:11,070 --> 00:31:13,400
Now we've buried the hatchet.

692
00:31:13,640 --> 00:31:14,720
Ordeals?

693
00:31:15,150 --> 00:31:22,270
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

694
00:31:15,510 --> 00:31:16,270
Dear,

695
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:17,440
did you suffer?

696
00:31:17,440 --> 00:31:18,680
No, I didn't suffer.

697
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:20,280
Don't listen to his rubbish.

698
00:31:20,830 --> 00:31:22,230
Really, I didn't suffer.

699
00:31:22,290 --> 00:31:30,060
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

700
00:31:22,640 --> 00:31:23,160
Look,

701
00:31:23,400 --> 00:31:24,550
aren't I perfectly fine?

702
00:31:24,550 --> 00:31:25,830
Don't you lie to me!

703
00:31:26,550 --> 00:31:27,880
I know you have your difficulties,

704
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,480
but the older generation...

705
00:31:30,080 --> 00:31:33,380
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

706
00:31:32,070 --> 00:31:33,830
I mean, you're so young.

707
00:31:33,410 --> 00:31:36,810
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

708
00:31:33,830 --> 00:31:35,280
Your happiness and comfort

709
00:31:35,280 --> 00:31:36,720
matter the most.

710
00:31:36,830 --> 00:31:44,100
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

711
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:39,110
Don't take everything upon yourself.

712
00:31:41,030 --> 00:31:42,160
That's right, Yunya.

713
00:31:42,160 --> 00:31:44,160
Don't always push yourself so hard.

714
00:31:44,160 --> 00:31:50,980
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

715
00:31:49,830 --> 00:31:50,750
Yan.

716
00:31:51,000 --> 00:31:58,190
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

717
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:53,880
Although I don't know who you really are,

718
00:31:54,270 --> 00:31:57,030
but since you have dealings with the Xies,

719
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:58,750
you must be no ordinary person.

720
00:31:58,380 --> 00:32:02,170
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

721
00:31:59,030 --> 00:32:00,240
Please take good care

722
00:32:00,920 --> 00:32:02,350
of my little girl.

723
00:32:02,190 --> 00:32:05,530
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

724
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:04,720
What are you saying?

725
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:05,720
I don't need his care.

726
00:32:05,550 --> 00:32:12,360
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

727
00:32:06,160 --> 00:32:06,880
Let's go, Granny.

728
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:08,080
Don't worry, Granny.

729
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:11,610
I'll take good care of your dear Yunya.

730
00:32:12,390 --> 00:32:18,990
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

731
00:32:16,590 --> 00:32:17,480
Let's go.

732
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:19,920
Slow down. Jeez.

733
00:32:21,460 --> 00:32:24,190
[Heng River Ferry Terminal]

734
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:23,590
Pay up! Pay up!

735
00:32:23,590 --> 00:32:24,790
Listen to me, everyone!

736
00:32:24,630 --> 00:32:27,180
[Xie Estate]

737
00:32:24,790 --> 00:32:26,070
It's been hell for us!

738
00:32:26,270 --> 00:32:27,830
We've weathered storms all year,

739
00:32:27,830 --> 00:32:29,680
just relying on this little harvest

740
00:32:29,680 --> 00:32:30,750
to earn some pennies to survive!

741
00:32:30,750 --> 00:32:32,270
Yes!

742
00:32:32,270 --> 00:32:33,070
As for them,

743
00:32:33,590 --> 00:32:35,750
they claim natural disasters
affected the harvest,

744
00:32:35,750 --> 00:32:38,000
but secretly embezzled our money

745
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:38,700
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

746
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:39,070
for private usury!

747
00:32:39,070 --> 00:32:40,340
Is there no justice?

748
00:32:40,370 --> 00:32:42,070
There's no justice!

749
00:32:42,090 --> 00:32:43,970
There's no justice!

750
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:46,160
Folks, we must make them pay up!

751
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:47,330
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

752
00:32:46,310 --> 00:32:48,110
We can't let them treat us like fools!

753
00:32:48,110 --> 00:32:49,350
Yes!

754
00:32:49,350 --> 00:32:50,270
Let's smash this place!

755
00:32:50,270 --> 00:32:52,760
Smash it! Smash it!

756
00:32:51,360 --> 00:32:52,620
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

757
00:32:52,790 --> 00:32:54,030
Smash it! Smash it!

758
00:32:52,840 --> 00:32:54,820
[Tea]

759
00:32:54,030 --> 00:32:56,160
What a brilliant move, Your Lordship.

760
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:58,640
Falsely claiming that
the estate manager's ledger was recovered

761
00:32:58,640 --> 00:33:00,880
and leaking news of the estate's deficit

762
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:02,750
really added fuel to the fire
for Xie Estate.

763
00:33:02,750 --> 00:33:03,610
Your Lordship,

764
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:06,070
right after you mentioned the ledger,

765
00:33:06,070 --> 00:33:08,310
Guo Baofeng went to
see Second Young Master.

766
00:33:08,310 --> 00:33:09,200
So the ledger

767
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:11,310
must be hidden in the Xie Residence.

768
00:33:11,750 --> 00:33:12,880
That's right.

769
00:33:13,310 --> 00:33:14,840
The estate manager is dead,

770
00:33:15,200 --> 00:33:17,130
and the ledger is in Xie Residence.

771
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:19,440
They can run, but they can't hide.

772
00:33:20,590 --> 00:33:22,720
Our best option is to wait for a chance

773
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:24,460
to look around the estate.

774
00:33:25,070 --> 00:33:27,070
I really feel sorry for Fourth Lady.

775
00:33:27,110 --> 00:33:29,110
She got caught in the crossfire
for no reason.

776
00:33:29,110 --> 00:33:31,040
I'm afraid this violent spectacle

777
00:33:31,110 --> 00:33:32,510
will reduce her to tears.

778
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:33,880
Not necessarily.

779
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,310
After all,

780
00:33:35,830 --> 00:33:37,960
she is the lady I chose.

781
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:45,130
Fourth Lady is here.

782
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:47,760
She really came.

783
00:33:48,590 --> 00:33:50,600
Pay up! Pay up!

784
00:33:50,620 --> 00:33:53,290
Pay up! Pay up!

785
00:33:53,310 --> 00:33:55,510
Pay up! Pay up!

786
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:57,340
My Lady, it's dangerous here.

787
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,880
If it doesn't work out, let's just leave.

788
00:33:58,880 --> 00:33:59,960
Since we're here,

789
00:34:00,240 --> 00:34:01,300
we can't be afraid.

790
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,270
Isn't that the manager?

791
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:04,480
Let's go!

792
00:34:04,510 --> 00:34:05,750
Let's go!

793
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:07,270
Let's go!

794
00:34:08,480 --> 00:34:10,170
Pay up! Pay up!

795
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:12,969
Pay up! Pay up!

796
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:15,480
Pay up! Pay up!

797
00:34:20,070 --> 00:34:20,840
Pay up!

798
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:23,050
Pay up! Pay up!

799
00:34:23,070 --> 00:34:25,310
Pay up! Pay up!

800
00:34:25,340 --> 00:34:27,290
Pay up! Pay up!

801
00:34:27,310 --> 00:34:29,440
Pay up! Pay up!

802
00:34:29,469 --> 00:34:32,030
Pay up! Pay up!

803
00:34:32,050 --> 00:34:36,480
Pay up! Pay up!

804
00:34:36,480 --> 00:34:37,400
Everyone!

805
00:34:37,630 --> 00:34:38,400
Silence!

806
00:34:38,460 --> 00:34:39,330
Pay up!

807
00:34:39,360 --> 00:34:41,840
I'm Xie Qingyuan,
the Fourth Lady of the Xie family.

808
00:34:41,840 --> 00:34:42,760
The elders have

809
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:43,880
put me in charge

810
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:45,030
of this estate.

811
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:46,590
Whatever grievances you have,

812
00:34:46,590 --> 00:34:47,760
you can let me know.

813
00:34:48,030 --> 00:34:50,230
I'll do my best to

814
00:34:50,230 --> 00:34:51,360
solve your problems.

815
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,190
Solve our problems?

816
00:34:52,190 --> 00:34:53,520
How will you solve them?

817
00:34:53,550 --> 00:34:54,840
You just want to repudiate the debt!

818
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:55,760
They took our money,

819
00:34:55,760 --> 00:34:57,920
and now they've got a woman to talk to us!

820
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,920
-Can you hear me out?
-What's there to hear?

821
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,550
Xies are all the same; all scum!

822
00:35:01,550 --> 00:35:03,110
Let's take her to the authorities!

823
00:35:03,110 --> 00:35:03,710
Wait.

824
00:35:04,550 --> 00:35:05,190
Can you...

825
00:35:05,190 --> 00:35:06,280
Can you hear me out first?

826
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:07,000
What are you doing?

827
00:35:07,000 --> 00:35:08,530
-Let go of My Lady!
-My Lord.

828
00:35:08,710 --> 00:35:09,550
Let go!

829
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,360
Let me go!

830
00:35:12,190 --> 00:35:12,840
Move!

831
00:35:14,590 --> 00:35:16,960
Your Lordship, Fourth Lady is...

832
00:35:18,030 --> 00:35:18,830
That's right.

833
00:35:19,190 --> 00:35:20,360
I am a Xie.

834
00:35:20,880 --> 00:35:23,140
But I didn't grow up in the Xie household.

835
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:29,900
Since I was little,

836
00:35:30,550 --> 00:35:32,010
I wandered outside alone.

837
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,120
My mother died early,

838
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,480
and I had no one to rely on.

839
00:35:37,440 --> 00:35:38,320
I used to

840
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:40,710
perform on the streets

841
00:35:40,960 --> 00:35:41,890
and beg for food.

842
00:35:42,890 --> 00:35:43,930
Sometimes,

843
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:45,220
for a bowl of porridge,

844
00:35:45,440 --> 00:35:47,640
I'd kowtow in front of a porridge stall.

845
00:35:47,670 --> 00:35:48,880
For a steamed bun,

846
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:51,510
I'd beg over half of Liuzhou.

847
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:55,230
I've seen countless
ugly faces of the rich.

848
00:35:55,800 --> 00:35:57,000
Your suffering today

849
00:35:58,030 --> 00:35:59,960
was my visceral pain yesterday.

850
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:02,800
Believe it or not,

851
00:36:03,230 --> 00:36:04,280
I, Xie Qingyuan,

852
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:06,280
sincerely want to

853
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:08,320
solve the problems for you.

854
00:36:08,320 --> 00:36:10,670
-Why should I trust you?
-Yeah! Why should I trust you?

855
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,670
Because I know

856
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:14,840
that for every day this money is delayed,

857
00:36:15,440 --> 00:36:17,230
more people will go hungry.

858
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:19,230
You can choose not to believe me,

859
00:36:19,230 --> 00:36:21,360
and I cannot represent the Xie family.

860
00:36:21,510 --> 00:36:24,280
But I, Xie Qingyuan, guarantee with my

861
00:36:24,510 --> 00:36:26,040
reputation and conscience

862
00:36:26,400 --> 00:36:29,200
that if the Xie family
doesn't pay back this money,

863
00:36:29,550 --> 00:36:30,510
I, Xie Qingyuan,

864
00:36:30,670 --> 00:36:32,270
will compensate you in full!

865
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:42,630
My Lady!

866
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:43,860
Your Lordship.

867
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:47,060
Bring me your IOUs.

868
00:36:59,710 --> 00:37:00,400
And mine.

869
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,810
-This is mine.
-Here's mine.

870
00:37:02,810 --> 00:37:03,610
This is my IOU.

871
00:37:05,200 --> 00:37:06,260
-Fingerprint mine first!
-Mine!

872
00:37:06,260 --> 00:37:07,180
Excuse me.

873
00:37:07,200 --> 00:37:07,780
Mine! Mine!

874
00:37:07,780 --> 00:37:08,360
Don't push.

875
00:37:08,360 --> 00:37:09,020
Don't push.

876
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:11,150
Is this real?

877
00:37:11,150 --> 00:37:12,280
My blood

878
00:37:12,960 --> 00:37:13,840
is my seal.

879
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:15,920
Within 7 days,

880
00:37:16,110 --> 00:37:18,170
with the IOU bearing my fingerprint,

881
00:37:18,230 --> 00:37:20,030
you can ask the estate for money.

882
00:37:20,230 --> 00:37:22,800
If the estate really owes you money,

883
00:37:23,400 --> 00:37:24,930
it'll be repaid threefold,

884
00:37:25,030 --> 00:37:26,360
and your rent will be halved!

885
00:37:26,360 --> 00:37:29,000
Bravo!

886
00:37:29,030 --> 00:37:31,070
Bravo!

887
00:37:31,100 --> 00:37:35,000
Bravo!

888
00:37:35,760 --> 00:37:37,800
She actually managed to put out

889
00:37:38,110 --> 00:37:39,550
the fire I started.

890
00:37:45,520 --> 00:37:50,400
[Bountiful Years and Abundant Harvests]

891
00:37:46,920 --> 00:37:49,980
As I thought, such a situation
doesn't faze you at alll.

892
00:37:50,760 --> 00:37:52,960
Lord Yan, you sure are in high spirits.

893
00:37:53,670 --> 00:37:55,480
When I was in grave danger just now,

894
00:37:55,480 --> 00:37:58,280
you just hid in the back
watching the drama unfold.

895
00:37:59,150 --> 00:38:00,800
You have a sharp mind.

896
00:38:00,880 --> 00:38:02,320
If I intervened rashly,

897
00:38:02,760 --> 00:38:04,550
wouldn't it ruin the good show?

898
00:38:07,190 --> 00:38:08,070
However...

899
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:13,880
if you fail to keep your promise,

900
00:38:16,000 --> 00:38:18,800
the tenants' backlash
will be beyond disastrous.

901
00:38:25,230 --> 00:38:27,800
How do you know I can't keep my promise?

902
00:38:29,670 --> 00:38:31,130
Then how will you solve it?

903
00:38:33,710 --> 00:38:34,640
Are you curious?

904
00:38:38,190 --> 00:38:40,880
Lord Yan, since you love
watching the drama

905
00:38:41,110 --> 00:38:43,590
and care so much about Xie Estate,

906
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:46,070
I must take you to see it for yourself.

907
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,650
If I tell you in advance,

908
00:38:47,920 --> 00:38:49,520
it'll ruin the fun, won't it?

909
00:38:55,210 --> 00:38:59,900
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

910
00:39:47,960 --> 00:39:49,150
Oh, Lord Yan. Stop.

911
00:39:49,320 --> 00:39:50,230
My darling,

912
00:39:51,030 --> 00:39:53,230
how's the task I assigned coming along?

913
00:39:53,590 --> 00:39:56,630
It's been completed, of course.

914
00:39:58,110 --> 00:40:00,230
It's worth everything I've done

915
00:40:00,480 --> 00:40:01,960
to get you the estate.

916
00:40:02,960 --> 00:40:06,110
You have incredible foresight, My Lord.

917
00:40:06,110 --> 00:40:07,880
Second Madam is indeed

918
00:40:08,150 --> 00:40:09,800
behind the private usury.

919
00:40:10,480 --> 00:40:12,920
But the account is in a deficit now.

920
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:15,800
That's why the tenants
were making a scene.

921
00:40:15,880 --> 00:40:17,920
Years of managing the household have made

922
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:19,280
Concubine Mei very resourceful.

923
00:40:19,280 --> 00:40:20,840
Even if we get evidence,

924
00:40:21,110 --> 00:40:22,370
she'll never admit it.

925
00:40:22,630 --> 00:40:24,890
She'll just have someone take the blame.

926
00:40:25,920 --> 00:40:27,230
That's of course.

927
00:40:27,630 --> 00:40:30,800
Second Madam is behind the scenes.

928
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:32,960
Nanny Rong is the one

929
00:40:33,480 --> 00:40:35,550
who actually handles everything.

930
00:40:37,480 --> 00:40:38,400
When Nanny Rong

931
00:40:38,400 --> 00:40:39,630
is arrested...

932
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:43,440
Did I hear something?

933
00:40:43,440 --> 00:40:45,670
Maybe it's a stray cat.

934
00:40:51,550 --> 00:40:53,440
You sure know how to joke.

935
00:41:01,150 --> 00:41:02,440
When Nanny Rong

936
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:04,590
is arrested and executed,

937
00:41:04,880 --> 00:41:06,280
the truth will be buried.

938
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:08,230
By then,

939
00:41:08,800 --> 00:41:10,320
Concubine Mei's name will be cleared.

940
00:41:10,320 --> 00:41:12,380
You'll also have unearthed the truth

941
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:14,120
and can answer to Old Madam.

942
00:41:15,320 --> 00:41:16,190
Yes.

943
00:41:16,840 --> 00:41:19,360
She's just a mere nanny.

944
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:21,480
Who will care if she dies?

945
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:24,360
So Second Madam put Nanny Rong in charge

946
00:41:24,840 --> 00:41:27,190
just to leave herself a way out.

947
00:41:31,150 --> 00:41:32,880
Then you should get ready

948
00:41:32,880 --> 00:41:34,710
to report to Old Madam tomorrow.
